\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Multi-Modal Phishing Detection Platform\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 SRS Report\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Version 2.0\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Prepared for Academic Project Documentation\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield analyzes suspicious URLs, SMS/email text, and screenshots to help users\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 identify phishing attempts before they act.\par
\page
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 Document Control\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 This Software Requirements Specification (SRS) defines the functional, quality,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 interface, data, security, and validation requirements for CyberShield. It is intended to\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 guide design, development, testing, review, and future maintenance.\par
