\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 Acknowledgement\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The CyberShield team gratefully acknowledges the guidance of its project mentor,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 faculty members, peers, and families whose feedback and encouragement support this\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 work. The project is shaped by the practical need to make phishing warnings\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 understandable and available before a user clicks a link, replies to a message, or shares\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 sensitive information.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The team also recognizes the security research community, standards bodies, and\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 open-source contributors whose work in secure systems, natural-language processing,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 image analysis, and threat intelligence informs the proposed design.\par
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 Abstract\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield is a multi-modal phishing detection platform. Its existing URL analysis\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 capability is extended by two complementary services: text analysis for SMS and email\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 content, and screenshot analysis for visual phishing indicators. The platform combines\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 cybersecurity intelligence with natural-language processing (NLP) and image\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 processing (IP) to provide a consistent, evidence-based risk assessment.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 A user can submit a URL, paste a message, or upload a screenshot. CyberShield\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 normalizes the input, performs modality-specific analysis, generates a risk score and\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 explanations, preserves a privacy-aware audit record, and provides safe next actions.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The proposed system is web-based, role-aware, scalable, and designed to minimize the\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 risk of overconfident or harmful automated advice.\par
\page
