\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Analyze, view history, submit feedback, manage\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 privacy settings.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Analyst\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Authorized security reviewer\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Review flagged cases and feedback; annotate\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 disposition.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Administrator\par
